WEBVTT

01:33.490 --> 01:37.450
EPISODE 7: RESTORATION OF RELICS

01:36.750 --> 01:40.930
<b>As I'm sure you know, 
this world is about to change.</b>

01:40.930 --> 01:47.090
<b>As chairman of TKBM, 
I can guarantee you any form of support.</b>

01:47.720 --> 01:50.090
<b>Work for me.</b>

01:53.690 --> 01:56.640
<b>First you want to "work together," 
then it's "work for me"?</b>

01:57.020 --> 01:59.390
<b>I know full well how evil you are.</b>

01:59.390 --> 02:01.140
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

02:02.130 --> 02:06.650
<b>Now, there's no need to get angry.
I didn't mean anything by it.</b>

02:06.950 --> 02:13.350
<b>We at TKBM have countless relics 
that you can use to your heart's content.</b>

02:13.350 --> 02:15.910
<b>From battle relics to healing relics...</b>

02:20.620 --> 02:23.620
<b><i>Healing relics I can use 
to my heart's content?</i></b>

02:23.620 --> 02:27.670
<b><i>I still remember how you used the 
Tree of Life to make me your slave.</i></b>

02:30.030 --> 02:34.030
<b><i>Don't underestimate me.
I won't fall for that again.</i></b>

02:36.090 --> 02:38.010
<b>Well, that was unexpected.</b>

02:38.640 --> 02:43.670
<b>You really are skilled. 
I was right about you.</b>

02:44.540 --> 02:45.980
<b>A relic's power?</b>

02:46.450 --> 02:48.980
<b>Yes. Finding it a bit spooky?</b>

02:50.540 --> 02:53.890
<b><i>The Body of Achilles 
Dipped in the River Styx.</i></b>

02:53.890 --> 02:56.490
<b><i>Achilles was a warrior of Greek mythology.</i></b>

02:56.960 --> 03:00.170
<b><i>When he was a child, his mother, Thetis,</i></b>

03:00.170 --> 03:03.630
<b><i>dippde him in the River Styx 
to make him stronger.</i></b>

03:04.500 --> 03:11.010
<b><i>But she held him by his heels, which kept 
them dry, so they became his weakness.</i></b>

03:11.010 --> 03:14.440
<b><i>Ogawara must have a weakness, too.</i></b>

03:14.440 --> 03:17.510
<b><i>I just can't figure out where it is.</i></b>

03:17.510 --> 03:21.360
<b>Do you finally understand 
that you can't beat me?</b>

03:21.360 --> 03:25.270
<b>Well? Do you need a 
little more time to think?</b>

03:25.270 --> 03:27.770
<b>Time? Yeah, I do need time.</b>

03:29.770 --> 03:34.740
<b>Time to slice that disgusting 
head of yours clean off.</b>

03:37.300 --> 03:40.120
<b>Give it everything you've got, Muramasa!</b>

03:40.760 --> 03:43.230
<b>What's the big idea, human?!</b>

03:44.470 --> 03:45.960
<b>You've gone mad!</b>

03:47.920 --> 03:49.460
<b>Stop!</b>

03:59.980 --> 04:02.970
<b><i>Damn it. It's already at its limit?</i></b>

04:08.120 --> 04:09.440
<b>Boss!</b>

04:11.610 --> 04:14.610
<b><i>The relic's power activates on its own?</i></b>

04:17.910 --> 04:19.320
<b>Hammurabi's Code!</b>

04:33.740 --> 04:36.780
<b><i>This is getting dangerous. 
I need to finish this quickly.</i></b>

05:11.050 --> 05:12.000
<b><i>Really?</i></b>

05:12.940 --> 05:15.640
<b><i>The relic's power is 
still keeping him alive?</i></b>

05:15.640 --> 05:17.290
<b><i>This is pissing me off.</i></b>

05:22.510 --> 05:24.180
<b>Ogawara!</b>

05:27.280 --> 05:30.210
<b><i>What? Is it completely destroyed?</i></b>

05:30.210 --> 05:33.020
<b><i>Hammurabi's Code is damaged, as well.</i></b>

05:33.550 --> 05:39.030
<b><i>The same should be true of his 
Achilles and King of Conquest relics.</i></b>

05:39.360 --> 05:41.700
<b><i>Which means they're useless for now.</i></b>

05:44.530 --> 05:46.540
IRENE HOLTON
CONNECTING...

05:47.530 --> 05:50.750
<b>Hello, Irene-san. It's me.</b>

05:50.750 --> 05:53.040
<b>Could I ask you for a favor?</b>

05:53.480 --> 05:56.050
<b>I need your help finding someone.</b>

05:56.540 --> 05:59.550
<b>A Japanese man named Yanagi Kotaro.</b>

06:03.600 --> 06:05.140
<b>What did you say?</b>

06:05.140 --> 06:08.890
<b>Yanagi Kotaro is already dead.</b>

06:11.670 --> 06:16.400
<b>You see, my brother is 
an avid art collector.</b>

06:16.810 --> 06:20.400
<b>A few months ago, 
that man sold him a forgery.</b>

06:21.460 --> 06:24.530
<b>He also introduced him to me back then.</b>

06:24.530 --> 06:27.230
<b>I remember what a good 
first impression I had of him.</b>

06:28.690 --> 06:32.330
<b>But the famous painting 
my brother bought from him</b>

06:32.330 --> 06:34.420
<b>turned out to be a forgery.</b>

06:32.690 --> 06:34.420
<b>Drive faster!</b>

06:34.420 --> 06:36.140
<b>We have to keep up with him!</b>

06:35.050 --> 06:39.800
<b>He and his friends chased 
after him, and that man's car</b>

06:36.140 --> 06:37.750
<b>Step on it!</b>

06:39.800 --> 06:43.010
<b>broke through the guardrail 
and fell off a cliff.</b>

06:44.360 --> 06:47.290
<b><i>I didn't expect that...</i></b>

06:47.840 --> 06:51.560
<b><i>Yanagi Kotaro is a restorer of relics.</i></b>

06:51.560 --> 06:55.640
<b><i>Relics can be depleted or 
destroyed in various ways.</i></b>

06:56.310 --> 07:01.570
<b><i>But there are restoration relics 
that can restore broken relics.</i></b>

07:01.570 --> 07:05.180
<b><i>The people who use them 
are called relic restorers.</i></b>

07:06.200 --> 07:11.920
<b><i>Yanagi was a member of my team. 
He was known as the King of Fraud.</i></b>

07:12.920 --> 07:16.620
<b>I'm very sorry I couldn't be of more help.</b>

07:16.620 --> 07:19.750
<b><i>Restoration relics are 
usually works of art,</i></b>

07:19.750 --> 07:21.700
<b><i>and they require high affinity.</i></b>

07:22.200 --> 07:24.630
<b><i>That's not something I can handle.</i></b>

07:25.380 --> 07:27.130
<b><i>This is a big problem...</i></b>

07:27.850 --> 07:28.960
<b><i>Wait a second.</i></b>

07:29.500 --> 07:32.500
<b><i>He should be around 26 right now.</i></b>

07:33.240 --> 07:37.350
<b><i>We don't meet each other 
until five years from now.</i></b>

07:37.350 --> 07:39.600
<b><i>So how could he already be dead?</i></b>

07:40.390 --> 07:43.860
<b>Irene-san, I have one more favor to ask.</b>

07:48.360 --> 07:52.330
SEKISUI UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL

07:50.320 --> 07:53.190
<b><i>Things remain unsettled at the scene.</i></b>

07:52.330 --> 08:01.000
REPAIRS DELAYED IN ORDER TO 
AVOID CAUSING FURTHER DAMAGE

07:53.190 --> 07:59.160
<b><i>Scientists suspect that the phenomenon 
is connected to the strange tombs.</i></b>

07:59.160 --> 08:02.160
<b><i>Will the mystery finally be solved?</i></b>

08:02.160 --> 08:05.670
<b><i>Next in the news, regarding 
the relics and their shocking—</i></b>

08:07.420 --> 08:10.690
<b>After all I did to keep
their existence secret...</b>

08:13.800 --> 08:19.070
<b>What, by making a big show of using 
them and even summoning a tomb?</b>

08:19.070 --> 08:20.990
<b>That was an accident!</b>

08:20.990 --> 08:23.940
<b>Who expects relics at an airport?!</b>

08:24.480 --> 08:28.700
<b>You possess the relic of immortality.</b>

08:29.290 --> 08:32.820
<b>How did a young thing like him 
do this much damage to you?</b>

08:33.730 --> 08:36.580
<b>Goriki Ryoga, was it?</b>

08:36.580 --> 08:40.330
<b>To think he could have 
managed this. Fascinating.</b>

08:40.730 --> 08:41.830
<b>Oh, shut up!</b>

08:41.830 --> 08:46.840
<b>At any rate, restoration is in order. 
I'll put you in touch with a restorer.</b>

08:47.530 --> 08:50.660
<b>Get some rest in the meantime.</b>

08:50.660 --> 08:54.680
<b>And don't let that Goriki Ryoga boy 
beat you half to death again.</b>

09:01.810 --> 09:04.920
<b><i>Edward, old buddy! It's been a while!</i></b>

09:05.440 --> 09:10.240
<b>Why, you answered your phone 
right away for once? I'm shocked.</b>

09:10.240 --> 09:13.780
<b>Is our master restorer short on cash?</b>

09:15.710 --> 09:18.330
<b><i>You know me far too well.</i></b>

09:18.330 --> 09:23.250
<b><i>I had some bad luck, and things got dicey,
so I gotta play dead for a while.</i></b>

09:23.250 --> 09:26.910
<b><i>Some people are demanding 
outrageous sums to keep quiet, too.</i></b>

09:26.910 --> 09:28.710
<b><i>I'm seriously starting to lose it.</i></b>

09:29.210 --> 09:34.390
<b>So the talented fraudster is 
even faking his own death now?</b>

09:34.390 --> 09:36.290
<b><i>Anyway, enough about that.</i></b>

09:36.290 --> 09:40.680
<b><i>Since you called, you must have 
a job that'll make me some money.</i></b>

09:40.680 --> 09:45.190
<b>Yes. Let's just say I've hooked 
the big fish you wanted.</b>

09:47.140 --> 09:51.660
<b><i>About the art markets operated
by people close to Yanagi...</i></b>

09:51.660 --> 09:54.020
<b><i>There are more than 50 across the country.</i></b>

09:54.020 --> 09:56.060
<b><i>Are you planning to visit all of them?</i></b>

09:56.980 --> 10:00.900
<b>B-Boss, is this finally the last one?</b>

10:01.410 --> 10:03.120
<b>I'm completely exhausted.</b>

10:03.810 --> 10:05.870
<b>Enough whining. Just come with me.</b>

10:07.510 --> 10:08.900
<b>Welcome!</b>

10:11.230 --> 10:15.380
<b>Are you looking for a particular piece? 
A painting, or a sculpture, or...</b>

10:15.380 --> 10:17.880
<b>We'd like to have some relics restored.</b>

10:19.240 --> 10:21.670
<b>Relics... restored?</b>

10:22.890 --> 10:26.850
<b>I'm terribly sorry, but we 
only deal in artwork here.</b>

10:26.850 --> 10:27.900
<b>Shut it!</b>

10:27.900 --> 10:31.990
<b>Don't bother lying! We know all 
about it! You wanna die, you—</b>

10:34.080 --> 10:36.980
<b>Idiot! Do you want to 
ruin everything for us?!</b>

10:36.980 --> 10:39.660
<b>You have to assert yourself early!</b>

10:39.660 --> 10:40.930
<b>Shut up, you thug!</b>

10:40.930 --> 10:41.540
<b>Thug?!</b>

10:41.540 --> 10:42.770
<b>What else would you be?</b>

10:42.770 --> 10:44.620
<b>I'm not just some dumb thug!</b>

10:45.330 --> 10:49.020
<b><i>S-So many relics! Where did he get them?!</i></b>

10:49.020 --> 10:51.830
<b><i>And they're all high-grade!</i></b>

10:55.900 --> 10:59.170
<b>It looks like you know what those are.</b>

11:02.750 --> 11:04.350
<b>Please.</b>

11:05.180 --> 11:07.890
<b>These relics are extremely precious to me,</b>

11:07.890 --> 11:09.860
<b>but they're all damaged.</b>

11:10.340 --> 11:14.500
<b>I was told I could have 
them restored here.</b>

11:15.140 --> 11:19.370
<b>Of course, I'll keep quiet. 
May I count on your help?</b>

11:21.060 --> 11:24.370
<b>Well... if that's the case...</b>

11:24.370 --> 11:27.600
<b>Would you mind waiting 
for a brief moment?</b>

11:31.670 --> 11:33.270
<b><i>Bingo!</i></b>

11:33.270 --> 11:38.180
<b><i>This woman was Yanagi's secretary. 
I'm sure she's contacting him now.</i></b>

11:38.890 --> 11:43.180
<b><i>Only he could handle relics of this level.</i></b>

11:43.500 --> 11:46.140
<b><i>I knew he was still alive!</i></b>

11:47.200 --> 11:49.100
<b>God Grade?</b>

11:49.100 --> 11:53.050
<b>They seemed pretty clueless. 
This will be child's play.</b>

11:53.050 --> 11:54.400
<b>So what do you say?</b>

11:55.880 --> 11:58.410
<b>We should show them all courtesy, then.</b>

12:00.500 --> 12:02.410
<b>Sorry for the wait.</b>

12:02.740 --> 12:07.360
<b>Normally, our services are 
reserved for members only,</b>

12:07.360 --> 12:10.920
<b>but given the urgency, we'd 
be happy to make an exception.</b>

12:11.550 --> 12:14.210
<b>Really? Thank you very much!</b>

12:14.570 --> 12:18.800
<b>May I take the relics for a moment 
to check their condition?</b>

12:19.720 --> 12:24.070
<b><i>Right now? Is Yanagi here?</i></b>

12:24.460 --> 12:26.720
<b><i>Hmm. Let's wait and see.</i></b>

12:27.290 --> 12:29.980
<b>Ah, of course. Please do.</b>

12:31.250 --> 12:35.980
<b>Damn, this is wild! How many 
are there? Who owns all these?</b>

12:36.280 --> 12:38.210
<b>What a sight.</b>

12:38.540 --> 12:40.990
<b>Are you sure this will be okay?</b>

12:41.440 --> 12:44.450
<b>It'll be fine. Stay at the front 
desk and watch them.</b>

12:44.450 --> 12:46.330
<b>This'll be a piece of cake.</b>

12:47.510 --> 12:51.820
<b><i>Yanagi was given the title 
King of Fraud for good reason.</i></b>

12:52.280 --> 12:55.900
<b><i>Because he uses the 
Secret Signature of the Forger,</i></b>

12:55.900 --> 12:58.340
<b><i>a B-grade duplication relic.</i></b>

12:58.770 --> 13:02.220
<b><i>He uses restoration as a pretext 
to keep the original</i></b>

13:02.220 --> 13:06.350
<b><i>while passing a fake off to the customer.</i></b>

13:07.920 --> 13:11.720
<b><i>The fake can even mimic 
the original's unique aura.</i></b>

13:11.720 --> 13:13.960
<b><i>The effect only lasts half a day,</i></b>

13:13.960 --> 13:16.610
<b><i>but until it does, no one 
knows they've been scammed.</i></b>

13:23.970 --> 13:25.660
<b>Thank you for your patience.</b>

13:26.460 --> 13:29.040
<b>No problem. How are the relics?</b>

13:29.550 --> 13:33.860
<b>I'm afraid their condition 
is far worse than expected,</b>

13:33.860 --> 13:37.170
<b>so restoration is 
unfortunately not possible.</b>

13:37.170 --> 13:39.170
<b>Oh, really?</b>

13:40.060 --> 13:41.680
<b><i>I knew it.</i></b>

13:43.480 --> 13:44.660
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

13:45.240 --> 13:47.970
<b>I'll call the police!</b>

13:48.360 --> 13:51.980
<b>Shut up! You just behave yourself!</b>

13:58.260 --> 13:59.480
<b>Who's there?</b>

14:02.780 --> 14:04.990
<b>Long time no see.</b>

14:05.400 --> 14:06.990
<b>Wh-Who are you?</b>

14:07.650 --> 14:09.160
<b>Tie him up, Rope!</b>

14:21.620 --> 14:24.880
<b>You dumb shit! 
What the hell are you doing?!</b>

14:24.880 --> 14:27.510
<b>Do you have any idea who I am?!</b>

14:27.930 --> 14:30.520
<b>Now, take it easy, Yanagi.</b>

14:30.520 --> 14:33.340
<b>We'll make a deal, then I'll let you go.</b>

14:33.340 --> 14:36.980
<b>Screw that! Just shut up 
and untie me, damn it!</b>

14:36.980 --> 14:40.520
<b>You can take your deal 
and shove it up your ass!</b>

14:39.590 --> 14:43.190
<b><i>Looks like he's already broken.</i></b>

14:40.520 --> 14:42.780
<b>Hey! You listening to me?!</b>

14:42.780 --> 14:45.020
<b>I said untie me right now!</b>

14:43.950 --> 14:47.070
<b><i>Yanagi wasn't always like this.</i></b>

14:45.020 --> 14:47.440
<b>What the hell are you staring at?!</b>

14:47.440 --> 14:49.260
<b>Why aren't you moving, damn it?!</b>

14:49.260 --> 14:52.830
<b><i>As a promising young artist,</i></b>

14:52.830 --> 14:57.100
<b><i>he was even offered a full scholarship 
by a prestigious university in the US.</i></b>

14:57.100 --> 15:01.430
<b><i>But then someone stole the technique 
he had spent years perfecting.</i></b>

15:04.250 --> 15:07.510
<b><i>The thief was none other than 
Gene Richard, his own teacher.</i></b>

15:07.510 --> 15:12.470
<b><i>To make matters worse, 
Yanagi was branded the plagiarist</i></b>

15:12.470 --> 15:14.880
<b><i>and driven out of the art world.</i></b>

15:15.800 --> 15:21.610
<b><i>That is how the young prodigy 
ended up using his talents elsewhere.</i></b>

15:23.060 --> 15:27.380
<b><i>He came across the Secret Signature 
relic at the lowest point of his life</i></b>

15:27.380 --> 15:30.160
<b><i>and started working as a scammer.</i></b>

15:31.070 --> 15:34.450
<b>Hey! How long are you 
gonna just stand there?!</b>

15:34.450 --> 15:39.460
<b>Can't you hear me, damn it?!
What, are you into this kinda thing?!</b>

15:35.190 --> 15:39.460
<b><i>There's no way I can talk 
him into it like this.</i></b>

15:39.460 --> 15:41.960
<b>Well, I'm not, okay?!</b>

15:41.960 --> 15:45.120
<b>Drop dead, you psychopath!</b>

15:45.470 --> 15:48.430
PATIENCE

15:46.980 --> 15:49.060
<b><i>To hell with being nice.</i></b>

15:49.990 --> 15:51.430
<b>Do you know what this is?</b>

15:51.940 --> 15:54.930
<b>This is Shakespeare's Adolescent Pen.</b>

15:55.340 --> 15:58.440
<b>Everything written with 
it becomes reality.</b>

15:58.440 --> 16:01.440
<b>H-Huh? What are you going to do with that?</b>

16:01.440 --> 16:04.730
<b>Poor Yanagi Kotaro, 
hanging in the air all tied up,</b>

16:04.730 --> 16:07.450
<b>shall suffer horrific pain before he dies.</b>

16:08.090 --> 16:10.450
<b>And the source of that pain</b>

16:11.540 --> 16:13.670
<b>shall be right between his legs.</b>

16:17.460 --> 16:20.460
THE FINAL DECISION THUS ALWAYS LIES WITH THE CLIENT.
BY SIGNING THIS CONTRACT, THE CONTRACTOR VOLUNTARILY 
TRANSFERS ALL OF THE ABOVE RIGHTS TO THE CLIENT.
CLIENT: GORIKI RYOGA
CONTRACTOR: YANAGI KOTARO

16:20.860 --> 16:23.960
<b>This is a total slave contract.</b>

16:24.410 --> 16:28.090
<b>Oh, please. I prefer the term
"exclusive contract."</b>

16:28.090 --> 16:30.590
<b>As if calling it something 
else changes anything!</b>

16:31.070 --> 16:32.720
<b>And what is this "Hammurabi's Code"</b>

16:32.720 --> 16:36.100
<b>that's supposed to 
punish me if I break it?!</b>

16:38.600 --> 16:43.480
<b>You conveniently skipped 
over the $6,000 contract fee?</b>

16:43.480 --> 16:46.700
<b>And you'll receive a bonus 
for every restoration.</b>

16:46.700 --> 16:48.500
<b>I'd call those good terms.</b>

16:48.990 --> 16:53.470
<b>Shut up! I'm already contracted 
with the chairman of TKBM!</b>

16:53.470 --> 16:56.260
<b>You know who that is, right? 
TKBM's chairman!</b>

16:56.260 --> 16:57.950
<b>You're just some NPC!</b>

16:57.950 --> 17:02.470
<b><i>TKBM? I see. This just got interesting.</i></b>

17:02.860 --> 17:06.570
<b><i>So Ogawara already knows about restorers.</i></b>

17:07.150 --> 17:09.240
<b><i>Well, now what?</i></b>

17:09.770 --> 17:13.320
<b><i>With the Hammurabi's Code contract, 
I've tied him to me for now,</i></b>

17:13.800 --> 17:18.980
<b><i>but I still have to win his trust if 
I want him to work on God Grade relics.</i></b>

17:22.180 --> 17:24.980
<b>Why don't we get to 
know each other a little?</b>

17:24.980 --> 17:28.270
<b>I'm Goriki Ryoga. I'm from Tokyo.</b>

17:28.270 --> 17:32.260
<b>I'm the leader of a new excavation team.</b>

17:32.260 --> 17:34.470
<b>And that's exactly what 
I want to recruit you for.</b>

17:34.470 --> 17:36.700
<b>Now it's your turn.</b>

17:37.500 --> 17:40.420
<b>I'm not telling you anything about me!</b>

17:40.420 --> 17:41.420
<b>Well, then...</b>

17:42.440 --> 17:44.250
<b>I'll have to do it for you.</b>

17:45.650 --> 17:49.240
<b>Yanagi Kotaro, art student 
currently studying abroad.</b>

17:49.240 --> 17:52.470
<b>Despite your talent and passion,</b>

17:52.470 --> 17:56.540
<b>you're currently scraping by 
in LA with art forgeries</b>

17:56.540 --> 17:58.970
<b>and are known as an 
imitator of Gene Richard.</b>

17:59.860 --> 18:01.770
<b>You don't know anything!</b>

18:01.770 --> 18:06.220
<b>That bastard Gene Richard copied <i>my</i> style!</b>

18:07.230 --> 18:09.180
<b>He copied you?</b>

18:10.020 --> 18:13.600
<b>Is personal art style 
really that easy to copy?</b>

18:14.260 --> 18:18.300
<b>Maybe it is, if you're looking 
at finished paintings.</b>

18:18.300 --> 18:22.640
<b>But that guy even painted 
works I had only imagined!</b>

18:23.170 --> 18:25.640
<b>It was like he could read my mind...</b>

18:26.020 --> 18:27.750
<b>I feel like I'm losing it!</b>

18:29.350 --> 18:31.500
<b>He read your mind?</b>

18:32.880 --> 18:34.720
<b>That might be possible.</b>

18:36.030 --> 18:38.810
<b>Gene Richard is probably using a relic.</b>

18:38.810 --> 18:42.820
<b>There are some that let the user 
copy other people's abilities.</b>

18:44.550 --> 18:47.000
<b>How do you know that? 
Are you absolutely sure?!</b>

18:47.000 --> 18:49.320
<b>I know a thing or two about relics.</b>

18:49.320 --> 18:50.980
<b>Okay, here's what we'll do.</b>

18:50.980 --> 18:55.450
<b>I'll get your painting technique back 
and restore your reputation.</b>

18:55.450 --> 18:59.490
<b>In return, you'll become 
my exclusive restorer. Well?</b>

19:00.360 --> 19:03.000
<b><i>Gene Richard... is a relic user?</i></b>

19:06.480 --> 19:07.730
<b>Hey!</b>

19:08.770 --> 19:10.500
<b>Boss, he's running away!</b>

19:11.170 --> 19:14.510
<b>Let him. It's obvious where he's going.</b>

19:16.830 --> 19:20.010
<b><i>So that's how he imitated me so easily?</i></b>

19:20.500 --> 19:24.640
<b><i>He's a relic user? 
You're finished, Gene Richard!</i></b>

19:26.620 --> 19:29.340
<b>The restorer Edward recommended?</b>

19:30.020 --> 19:32.740
<b>What brings you to me?</b>

19:32.740 --> 19:35.030
<b>I thought you had gone into hiding.</b>

19:35.430 --> 19:38.570
<b>I'll take the restoration job.</b>

19:38.970 --> 19:41.300
<b>Oh, you will? Great.</b>

19:41.300 --> 19:43.090
<b>However, I have one condition.</b>

19:43.090 --> 19:44.080
<b>A condition?</b>

19:44.490 --> 19:49.190
<b><i>I know he owns an 
enormous relic collection.</i></b>

19:49.190 --> 19:52.090
<b><i>A deal with him will benefit me far more.</i></b>

19:52.390 --> 19:54.930
<b>Yes. You must know Gene Richard.</b>

19:54.930 --> 19:59.050
<b>Of course. He's that world-famous artist.</b>

19:59.050 --> 20:04.470
<b>He came into that fame by using 
a relic to copy my technique.</b>

20:04.470 --> 20:07.220
<b>Please take that relic from him.</b>

20:07.220 --> 20:11.060
<b>In return, I'll sign an
 exclusive contract with you.</b>

20:15.950 --> 20:17.660
<b>How amusing.</b>

20:20.510 --> 20:24.520
<b>Hello, Richard. I just heard 
something very interesting.</b>

20:24.520 --> 20:26.040
<b>Do you know a Yanagi Kotaro?</b>

20:29.440 --> 20:32.910
<b><i>Do you realize where you are, Yanagi?</i></b>

20:32.910 --> 20:35.420
<b><i>I told you to lay low 
if you wanted to live.</i></b>

20:35.960 --> 20:40.710
<b><i>Do I have to bury you alive 
this time for you to get it?!</i></b>

20:40.710 --> 20:43.440
<b>Easy now, Richard.</b>

20:43.440 --> 20:45.500
<b>I'll take care of him.</b>

20:47.170 --> 20:50.440
<b>Well, now what? Sorry to disappoint you,</b>

20:50.900 --> 20:54.740
<b>but Richard and I are very close.</b>

21:02.010 --> 21:05.910
<b>Wh-What's your problem? 
Why'd you hit me out of nowhere?!</b>

21:07.910 --> 21:10.520
<b>Just don't break his arms.</b>

21:10.520 --> 21:11.420
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

21:11.820 --> 21:13.540
<b>You damn bastards!</b>

21:23.140 --> 21:24.890
<b><i>The plan worked.</i></b>

21:27.400 --> 21:30.770
<b><i>In fact, I'd say he's my fan now.</i></b>
